  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 169
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 修士间的对决，体内五行灵气的数量最为重要。如果你体内的灵气已经不足以释放法术了，就只能先{color=red}结束回合{/color}，再重新吸收天地灵气。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 2
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114945495392461512
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1157969534378510}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 170
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 随着修为的提升，你体内能够储存的{color=red}灵气上限{/color}也会越来越多。只有这样，你才能使用那些更为强大的神通。
